{
  "kind": "html",
  "caption": "用动态规划记录凑出每个金额所需的最少硬币数：dp[0] = 0，其余位置初始为不可达。对每个金额尝试所有不超过它的硬币，并用 dp[x - coin] + 1 更新最优值。示例中 dp[11] 最终为 3，沿选择回溯得到 11 = 5 + 5 + 1；若目标位置始终不可达则返回 -1。",
  "html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\">\n<title>零钱兑换动态规划演示</title>\n<style>\n*{box-sizing:border-box}html,body{margin:0;background:#1c1c1c;color:#d4d4d4;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,\"PingFang SC\",sans-serif;font-size:14px}body{padding:24px}main{width:100%;max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto}.panel{padding:20px;background:#252526;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:10px;margin-bottom:20px}.intro{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:16px;align-items:center}.coins{display:flex;gap:10px}.coin{min-width:46px;padding:9px 14px;text-align:center;border:1px solid #666;border-radius:999px;background:#333;font-family:\"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace;font-size:16px}.amount{margin-left:auto;padding:10px 14px;background:#333;border-radius:7px}.num{font-family:\"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace}.formula{line-height:1.8;color:#bfbfbf}.formula strong{color:#3794ff}.status{min-height:54px;padding:14px 16px;background:#2d2d30;border-left:4px solid #3794ff;border-radius:6px;line-height:1.7;margin-bottom:20px}.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(12,minmax(62px,1fr));gap:10px}.cell{min-height:78px;padding:9px 6px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;background:#2d2d30;border:1px solid #555;border-radius:7px;transition:background .35s,border-color .35s,color .35s}.cell .index{font-size:13px;color:#9d9d9d}.cell .value{font-family:\"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace;font-size:19px}.cell.active{background:#0e639c;border-color:#3794ff;color:#fff}.cell.active .index{color:#dbeeff}.cell.done{border-color:#3794ff}.legend{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px 20px;margin-top:18px;color:#aaa}.legend span{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px}.dot{width:14px;height:14px;border-radius:3px;background:#2d2d30;border:1px solid #555}.dot.blue{background:#0e639c;border-color:#3794ff}.path{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px;align-items:center;min-height:48px}.step{padding:9px 12px;border:1px solid #555;border-radius:6px;background:#2d2d30;font-family:\"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace}.step.on{background:#0e639c;border-color:#3794ff;color:#fff}.arrow{color:#3794ff;font-size:18px}.result{margin-top:18px;padding:14px;border-radius:7px;background:#333;line-height:1.7}.result strong{color:#3794ff;font-family:\"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace;font-size:18px}@media(max-width:780px){body{padding:14px}.grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(62px,1fr))}.amount{margin-left:0;width:100%}}\n/* COMPACT */ html,body{font-size:12px!important;line-height:1.45!important}body{padding:8px 10px 10px!important}main{max-width:560px!important}.panel{padding:8px 10px!important;border-radius:6px!important;margin-bottom:8px!important;border:1px solid #3c3c3c!important}.grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(6,38px)!important;gap:6px!important;justify-content:start}.cell{min-height:48px!important;padding:4px 2px!important;border-radius:4px!important;border-width:1px!important}.cell .index{font-size:10px!important;color:#8d8d8d!important}.cell .value{font-size:13px!important}.coin{padding:2px 7px!important;border-radius:4px!important;font-size:12px!important;min-width:auto!important}.status{border-left-width:3px!important;padding:8px 10px!important;margin-bottom:8px!important;min-height:auto!important}.step{padding:2px 7px!important;border-radius:4px!important;font-size:12px!important}\n#grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(6,44px)!important}#grid .index{white-space:nowrap}</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main>\n<section class=\"panel intro\">\n<div>硬币面额</div><div class=\"coins\"><div class=\"coin\">1</div><div class=\"coin\">2</div><div class=\"coin\">5</div></div><div class=\"amount\">目标金额：<span class=\"num\">11</span></div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"panel\">\n<div class=\"formula\"><strong>状态：</strong>dp[x] 表示凑出金额 x 的最少硬币数。<br><strong>转移：</strong>dp[x] = min(dp[x], dp[x - coin] + 1)。</div>\n</section>\n<div id=\"status\" class=\"status\"></div>\n<section class=\"panel\">\n<div id=\"grid\" class=\"grid\"></div>\n<div class=\"legend\"><span><i class=\"dot blue\"></i>当前变化</span><span><i class=\"dot\"></i>尚未处理或已稳定</span><span>∞ 表示暂时无法凑出</span></div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"panel\">\n<div>最优组合回溯</div>\n<div id=\"path\" class=\"path\" style=\"margin-top:16px\"></div>\n<div id=\"result\" class=\"result\">等待动态规划完成……</div>\n</section>\n</main>\n<script>\nconst coins=[1,2,5],amount=11,dp=Array(amount+1).fill(Infinity),choice=Array(amount+1).fill(0),frames=[];dp[0]=0;\nconst snapshot=(a,t,p,r=false)=>frames.push({v:dp.map(x=>Number.isFinite(x)?x:'∞'),a,t,p,r});\nsnapshot([0],'初始化: dp[0] = 0, 其余金额暂时不可达.');\nfor(let x=1;x<=amount;x++)for(const coin of coins){if(coin>x)continue;const previous=dp[x],candidate=dp[x-coin]+1;const improved=candidate<previous;if(candidate<=previous){dp[x]=candidate;choice[x]=coin;}\n snapshot([x,x-coin],'金额 '+x+', 尝试硬币 '+coin+': dp['+(x-coin)+'] + 1 = '+candidate+(improved?', 更新 dp['+x+'] = '+dp[x]:', 保留最少枚数 '+dp[x])+(candidate===previous?' (并列时记录当前硬币供回溯)':'')+'.');}\nlet remaining=amount,backtrackPath=[amount];snapshot([amount],'dp[11] = 3, 开始按记录的硬币回溯.',backtrackPath.slice());\nwhile(remaining>0){const coin=choice[remaining],old=remaining;remaining-=coin;backtrackPath.push(remaining);snapshot([old,remaining],old+' 选择硬币 '+coin+', 剩余 '+remaining+'.',backtrackPath.slice(),remaining===0);}\n\nconst grid=document.getElementById('grid'),status=document.getElementById('status'),path=document.getElementById('path'),result=document.getElementById('result');\nfor(let i=0;i<=11;i++){const c=document.createElement('div');c.className='cell';c.innerHTML='<div class=\"index\">金额 '+i+'</div><div class=\"value\">∞</div>';grid.appendChild(c)}\nfunction render(f){status.textContent=f.t;[...grid.children].forEach((c,i)=>{c.querySelector('.value').textContent=f.v[i];c.className='cell'+(f.a.includes(i)?' active':'')+(f.v[i]!=='∞'?' done':'')});path.innerHTML='';if(f.p){f.p.forEach((n,i)=>{const s=document.createElement('div');s.className='step on';s.textContent=n;path.appendChild(s);if(i<f.p.length-1){const a=document.createElement('div');a.className='arrow';a.textContent='− '+(f.p[i]-f.p[i+1])+' →';path.appendChild(a)}})}result.innerHTML=f.r?'最少硬币数：<strong>3</strong>，组合为 <span class=\"num\">5 + 5 + 1 = 11</span>。':'当前正在计算或回溯最优解……'}\nlet i=0;render(frames[0]);setInterval(()=>{i=(i+1)%frames.length;render(frames[i])},1900);\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>",
  "svg": "",
  "media": ""
}
